{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794327417456,"sessionID":"ses_e39c0874fffefk6JJfDw1Lex68","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_01_f03tkyck3ni8k1zm3mh2bbny","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/README.md"},"output":"<path>/workspace/README.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # App\n2: \n3: ## Run contract\n4: \n5: - The app is built from `Dockerfile` in this directory and the container listens on port 8000.\n6: - The API is served under `/api`. `GET /api/health` answers `{\"status\": \"ok\"}` once the app is ready.\n7: - The backend also serves the frontend build at `/`.\n8: - Persistent data lives in `./data` (relative to the working directory `/app`).\n9: \n10: ## Layout\n11: \n12: - `backend/`: the Flask app (`backend/app.py`, served by gunicorn as `app:app`); dependencies in `backend/requirements.txt`.\n13: - `frontend/`: a Vite project (React + TypeScript). `npm run build` writes `frontend/dist`, which the image copies next to the backend.\n14: \n15: Dependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved versions and is installed as a pip constraints file. The frontend uses `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`). When you change dependencies, update the lock file as well (or remove it).\n\n(End of file - total 15 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# App\n\n## Run contract\n\n- The app is built from `Dockerfile` in this directory and the container listens on port 8000.\n- The API is served under `/api`. `GET /api/health` answers `{\"status\": \"ok\"}` once the app is ready.\n- The backend also serves the frontend build at `/`.\n- Persistent data lives in `./data` (relative to the working directory `/app`).\n\n## Layout\n\n- `backend/`: the Flask app (`backend/app.py`, served by gunicorn as `app:app`); dependencies in `backend/requirements.txt`.\n- `frontend/`: a Vite project (React + TypeScript). `npm run build` writes `frontend/dist`, which the image copies next to the backend.\n\nDependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved versions and is installed as a pip constraints file. The frontend uses `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`). When you change dependencies, update the lock file as well (or remove it).","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/workspace/README.md","text":"# App\n\n## Run contract\n\n- The app is built from `Dockerfile` in this directory and the container listens on port 8000.\n- The API is served under `/api`. `GET /api/health` answers `{\"status\": \"ok\"}` once the app is ready.\n- The backend also serves the frontend build at `/`.\n- Persistent data lives in `./data` (relative to the working directory `/app`).\n\n## Layout\n\n- `backend/`: the Flask app (`backend/app.py`, served by gunicorn as `app:app`); dependencies in `backend/requirements.txt`.\n- `frontend/`: a Vite project (React + TypeScript). `npm run build` writes `frontend/dist`, which the image copies next to the backend.\n\nDependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved versions and is installed as a pip constraints file. The frontend uses `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`). When you change dependencies, update the lock file as well (or remove it).","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":15,"totalLines":15,"truncated":false}},"title":"README.md","time":{"start":1794327417381,"end":1794327417450}},"id":"prt_1c63f9218001m4aDpsgiEzP11l","sessionID":"ses_e39c0874fffefk6JJfDw1Lex68","messageID":"msg_1c63f7f40001jbWE73dAmPK3Tn"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794327417770,"sessionID":"ses_e39c0874fffefk6JJfDw1Lex68","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_00_giakgntp1eqyq41l5ex5t5l6","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"find . -maxdepth 3 -not -path '*/node_modules/*' -not -path '*/.git/*' | sort"},"output":".\n./.dockerignore\n./.git\n./Dockerfile\n./README.md\n./backend\n./backend/app.py\n./backend/requirements.lock\n./backend/requirements.txt\n./frontend\n./frontend/index.html\n./frontend/package-lock.json\n./frontend/package.json\n./frontend/src\n./frontend/src/App.tsx\n./frontend/src/main.tsx\n./frontend/vite.config.ts\n","metadata":{"output":".\n./.dockerignore\n./.git\n./Dockerfile\n./README.md\n./backend\n./backend/app.py\n./backend/requirements.lock\n./backend/requirements.txt\n./frontend\n./frontend/index.html\n./frontend/package-lock.json\n./frontend/package.json\n./frontend/src\n./frontend/src/App.tsx\n./frontend/src/main.tsx\n./frontend/vite.config.ts\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"find . -maxdepth 3 -not -path '*/node_modules/*' -not -path '*/.git/*' | sort","time":{"start":1794327417364,"end":1794327417630}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c63f9209001XsuxX6bQEszupk","sessionID":"ses_e39c0874fffefk6JJfDw1Lex68","messageID":"msg_1c63f7f40001jbWE73dAmPK3Tn"}}
